## What works
- link generation
- link redirection
- global analytics

## What is missing
- Reward feature
- tests

## DB Justification
Postgres has a very conveniant Promise-based API for node.js.

## Trade-offs
- No reward feature
- No tests

## AI prompts
Implement a REST API for generating shareable short links for submitted target URLs and tracking them. Create an endpoint POST /links that generates a short, unique URL for a target URL and stores it in a Postgres database using @backend/src/db.ts . Requests for the same URL will return the existing URL stored in the database.